NOTE: this licence covers beeline's own SOURCE CODE only.

The repository and the built game also ship third-party GEODATA — elevation,
land cover, soil and climate rasters — which remain under their own licences and
are NOT relicensed by the above. Every one of them requires attribution.
See ATTRIBUTION.md, which must ship with any distribution of the built game.

One dependency is not MIT: src/fields/erosionFilter.ts is a port of Rune
Skovbo Johansen's erosion filter and is MPL-2.0. Its own header carries the
notice; MPL-2.0 is file-scoped, so it does not affect the rest of this tree.
